    "description": {
      "value": "Semiprecious gemstones emerge, seemingly at random, from the surface of this gnarled wooden staff. While wielding it, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to checks to identify divination magic.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.\n\n- **Cantrip** detect magic\n- **1st** true strike\n- **2nd** comprehend language, darkvision, see invisibility"
